@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@analysisId = REEMPLAZAR_TRAS_ANALIZAR
@token = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Salud
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login analista de demostración
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "analista",
  "password": "analista123"
}

### Estado Gemini/Gmail/correo (no expone secretos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Identidad de la sesión
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear analista (sólo admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "analista1",
  "password": "Analista-1234",
  "role": "analyst"
}

### Listar usuarios (sólo admin; nunca devuelve hashes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desactivar analista y revocar todas sus sesiones (sólo admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/analista1/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### Analizar PDF normal (VS Code REST Client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="extraction_mode"

normal
--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="estado.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../data/estado_financiero_ejemplo.pdf
--Boundary--

### Para OCR cambia `normal` por `ocr`; requiere Gemini probado y admite hasta OCR_MAX_PAGES.

### Probar clave Gemini configurada
POST {{baseUrl}}/settings/gemini/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Probar clave Resend guardada
POST {{baseUrl}}/settings/resend/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preparar URL OAuth de Gmail (requiere Client ID/Secret guardados)
POST {{baseUrl}}/settings/gmail/authorize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Probar autorización Gmail guardada
POST {{baseUrl}}/settings/gmail/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calcular escenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyses/{{analysisId}}/projection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initial_investment": "100000",
  "cash_flows": ["30000", "35000", "40000", "45000"],
  "discount_rate_percent": "10"
}

### Preguntar por ROA
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analysis_id": "{{analysisId}}",
  "pregunta": "¿Para qué sirve el ROA?"
}

### Descargar CSV con escenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyses/{{analysisId}}/report/csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "initial_investment": "100000",
  "cash_flows": ["30000", "35000", "40000", "45000"],
  "discount_rate_percent": "10"
}

### Descargar PDF sin escenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyses/{{analysisId}}/report/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Enviar reporte (prioridad Gmail, fallback Resend/SMTP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyses/{{analysisId}}/email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient": "analista@example.com"
}

### Cerrar sesión y revocar este JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
